# Tabul Dashboard - Cursor Rules

## 🎯 Proje Genel Bakış

Bu Flutter Web dashboard projesi Clean Architecture prensiplerini takip eder. Tüm kod değişiklikleri bu kurallara uygun olmalıdır.

## 📁 Klasör Yapısı ve Organizasyon

### Temel Yapı
- `lib/core/` - Core functionality (tema, network, constants, DI)
- `lib/features/` - Feature modules (her feature kendi klasöründe)
- `lib/shared/` - Reusable components ve utilities

### Feature Yapısı (Clean Architecture)
```
features/[feature_name]/
├── data/
│   ├── data_sources/     # API calls, local storage
│   ├── models/          # Data models with fromJson/toJson
│   └── repositories/    # Repository implementations
├── domain/
│   ├── entities/        # Business entities
│   ├── repositories/    # Repository abstracts
│   └── use_cases/       # Business logic
└── presentation/
    ├── cubit/          # State management
    ├── pages/          # Screen widgets
    └── widgets/        # Feature-specific widgets
```

## 🎨 Code Style ve Naming Conventions

### Dart/Flutter Standartları
- Flutter analysis_options.yaml kurallarını takip et
- `dart format` ile formatting yap
- `dart analyze` ile static analysis yap
- Linter warnings'leri resolve et

### Naming Conventions
- **Files**: snake_case (örn: `app_button.dart`)
- **Classes**: PascalCase (örn: `AppButton`, `ThemeCubit`)
- **Variables/Functions**: camelCase (örn: `primaryColor`, `getUserData`)
- **Constants**: SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE (örn: `API_BASE_URL`)
- **Private members**: underscore prefix (örn: `_privateMethod`)

### Widget Naming
- Page widgets: `[FeatureName]Page` (örn: `DashboardPage`)
- Component widgets: `App[ComponentName]` (örn: `AppButton`, `AppCard`)
- Feature widgets: `[FeatureName][WidgetName]` (örn: `DashboardHeader`)

## 🏗️ Architecture Kuralları

### Clean Architecture Layers
1. **Presentation Layer**
   - UI widgets, pages, state management (Cubit/Bloc)
   - Business logic YAZMAYACAKSIN - sadece use case'leri çağır
   - Dependency: domain layer

2. **Domain Layer**
   - Business entities, use cases, repository abstracts
   - Framework'den independent olmalı
   - Dependency: yok (pure Dart)

3. **Data Layer**
   - Repository implementations, data sources, models
   - External dependencies (API, database, storage)
   - Dependency: domain layer

### 🚨 **CRITICAL: Navigation Architecture Rules**
**BU KURALLARI ASLA İHLAL ETME!**

1. **State-Based Navigation ONLY**
   - Sidebar navigation için sadece `setState()` kullan
   - `context.go()`, `context.push()`, `Navigator.push()` YASAK
   - MainLayout içinde `_currentRoute` state'i ile content değiştir

2. **Router Configuration**
   - GoRouter'da `builder:` kullan, `pageBuilder:` YASAK
   - Animation'lar tamamen kaldırılmalı
   - Tek route yeterli (MainLayout handles everything)

3. **Content Switching**
   ```dart
   // DOĞRU ✅
   onNavigate: (route) {
     setState(() { _currentRoute = route; });
   }
   
   // YANLIŞ ❌
   onNavigate: (route) {
     context.go(route); // Animation yapar!
   }
   ```

4. **Layout Structure**
   - MainLayout = Persistent layout (sidebar + header)
   - Content area = Dynamic based on _currentRoute
   - Zero page transitions, sadece content değişir

### State Management (BLoC/Cubit)
- Her feature için ayrı Cubit/Bloc
- State classes: `sealed class` kullan
- Event classes: `sealed class` kullan (Bloc için)
- Cubit/Bloc dosyaları: `[feature]_cubit.dart` / `[feature]_bloc.dart`

### Dependency Injection
- GetIt service locator kullan
- Registration: `injection_container.dart`
- Layer-based registration (external, repositories, use cases, cubits)
- Constructor injection tercih et

## 🎨 UI/UX Kuralları

### Theme System
- `AppColors` class'ından color kullan
- `AppTypography` class'ından text style kullan
- `AppSpacing` class'ından spacing kullan
- `AppShadows` class'ından shadow kullan
- Hard-coded colors/sizes kullanma

### Responsive Design
- `ResponsiveBreakpoints` class'ından breakpoint kullan
- `context.deviceType` ile device type check et
- Mobile-first approach
- Layout widgets: `ResponsiveRowColumn`, `ResponsiveValue`

### Component Development
- Shared components: `shared/components/` klasöründe
- `App` prefix ile başla (örn: `AppButton`)
- Constructor'da required parameters net belirt
- Default values sağla
- Comprehensive documentation yaz

## 📝 Documentation Kuralları

### Code Documentation
- Public classes ve methods için dartdoc kullan
- Complex business logic için inline comment
- TODO comments için format: `// TODO: [Description] - [Date] - [Author]`
- FIXME comments için format: `// FIXME: [Description] - [Date] - [Author]`

### README Update
- Yeni feature eklerken README'yi güncelle
- Installation ve usage instructions güncel tut
- Screenshots ve examples ekle

## 🔧 Development Workflow

### File Creation
- Yeni feature oluştururken Clean Architecture structure'ı takip et
- Barrel export files (`index.dart`) oluştur
- Test files için: `[file_name]_test.dart`

### Code Review Checklist
- [ ] Clean Architecture principles uygulandı mı?
- [ ] Naming conventions doğru mu?
- [ ] Theme system kullanıldı mı?
- [ ] Responsive design uygulandı mı?
- [ ] Error handling yapıldı mı?
- [ ] Documentation yeterli mi?
- [ ] Tests yazıldı mı?

### Git Commit Messages
```
type(scope): description

Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore
Scope: feature name veya file/module name
```

Örnekler:
- `feat(dashboard): implement responsive dashboard layout`
- `fix(theme): resolve dark mode color contrast issue`
- `docs(readme): update installation instructions`

## 🚨 Error Handling

### Failure Classes
- Custom failure classes kullan (`core/error/failures.dart`)
- Network errors için: `NetworkFailure`
- Server errors için: `ServerFailure`
- Validation errors için: `ValidationFailure`

### Error States
- UI'da error states handle et
- User-friendly error messages göster
- Retry mechanisms sağla
- Loading states implement et

## 📱 Responsive Design Guidelines

### Breakpoints
```dart
mobile: ≤600px
tablet: 601px-1024px  
desktop: >1024px
```

### Layout Rules
- Mobile-first approach
- Touch targets: minimum 44x44 logical pixels
- Text scaling: support system font scaling
- Horizontal scrolling yasak (vertical scrolling OK)

### Navigation
- Mobile: Bottom navigation veya drawer
- Tablet: Sidebar navigation
- Desktop: Persistent sidebar navigation

## 🔐 Security Best Practices

### API Integration
- Environment variables kullan
- API keys kod içinde hard-code etme
- Token refresh mechanism implement et
- HTTPS kullan

### Input Validation
- User inputs'ları validate et
- Sanitize user data
- XSS protection
- SQL injection protection (backend)

## 🧪 Testing Guidelines

### Test Structure
```
test/
├── unit/           # Unit tests
├── widget/         # Widget tests  
├── integration/    # Integration tests
└── golden/         # Golden file tests
```

### Test Naming
- Test files: `[feature]_test.dart`
- Test groups: `group('[ClassName]', () {})`
- Test cases: `test('should [expected behavior] when [condition]', () {})`

### Coverage
- Minimum %80 code coverage
- Business logic: %100 coverage
- UI widgets: minimum %60 coverage

## 🚀 Performance Guidelines

### Widget Performance
- `const` constructors kullan
- `ListView.builder` için lazy loading
- Large lists için pagination
- Image optimization (WebP, proper sizing)

### State Management
- Unnecessary rebuilds'i önle
- `BlocBuilder` yerine `BlocSelector` kullan (specific data için)
- State caching implement et

## 📦 Dependencies

### Dependency Management
- Yeni dependency eklerken PRD'yi güncelle
- Version pinning: major version fix, minor flexible
- Unused dependencies temizle
- License compatibility check et

### Preferred Packages
- State Management: `flutter_bloc`
- Routing: `go_router`
- DI: `get_it`
- HTTP: `dio`
- Storage: `shared_preferences`
- Charts: `fl_chart`

